{"2755280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stranded in Conflict", "steam_appid": 2755280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a decaying Eastern European concrete block, you’re not a soldier — you’re just trying to survive. Escape your commie flat while dodging threats from all sides: buzzing drones, thunderous artillery, bursts of gunfire, armored vehicles, and the ever-present shadow of the draft officer who won’t stop until you’re caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner could be your last — hiding under the bed or stuffing yourself in the fridge won’t cut it this time. Outsmart, outmaneuver, and outlast as you search for the perfect hiding place in a world where the walls themselves feel hostile.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/bcab639ede8a6bd361ee11eb1e21ed83.avif?t=1775540281\" width=1560 height=633 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats</strong> — Patrol drones sweep the streets, their spotlights cutting through the smog while cameras record every twitch. The buildings and corruption remain unchanged from the post-Soviet days, but the war has upgraded: drones now rule the battlefield. They’ll usually ignore you — not out of mercy for civilians, but because you’re simply worth less than their spare parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/4b988e27cae807ac00e43125e7d3dd54.poster.avif?t=1775540281\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/4b988e27cae807ac00e43125e7d3dd54.webm?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/4b988e27cae807ac00e43125e7d3dd54.mp4?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Fire</strong> — Artillery shells and small-arms fire rip through the landscape. In theory, both armies avoid targeting civilians… but this is Eastern Europe. Stray rockets, random barrages, and the occasional burst of small-arms fire are just part of the ambiance. And don’t forget those ever-persistent draft officers, taking potshots like it’s their national pastime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/14a60b70dcc4a5f63c6c0d3b90e83e6b.poster.avif?t=1775540281\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/14a60b70dcc4a5f63c6c0d3b90e83e6b.webm?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/14a60b70dcc4a5f63c6c0d3b90e83e6b.mp4?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steel Monsters</strong> – Tanks and APCs roll past, rattling the earth as they prowl for anyone dumb enough to cross their path. Basements and sewers may be your best bet — though down there, the local gopnik population rules supreme. They’re territorial, tracksuits bristling, and dangerously sober… unless, of course, you can placate them with the sacred offering of a High Voltage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.poster.avif?t=1775540281\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.webm?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.mp4?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Draft Officer</strong> — the most dangerous predator of all. He doesn’t need guns, just a clipboard and a flashlight. Yet he still carries one in case you decide to flee, driven by a relentless determination to avoid the frontlines himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.poster.avif?t=1775540281\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.webm?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.mp4?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Easy Hiding</strong> – Beds and fridges won’t save you. Find unexpected hiding spots, blend with the environment, and stay one step ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/f7d8cc7059ea2bd4d47cdff284622fa3.poster.avif?t=1775540281\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/f7d8cc7059ea2bd4d47cdff284622fa3.webm?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/f7d8cc7059ea2bd4d47cdff284622fa3.mp4?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Survival</strong> – Stark Soviet-style architecture, the oppressive sounds of conflict outside, and the claustrophobic tension of being hunted — for Westerners, it’s straight out of a horror movie; for Eastern European <i>kommunalka</i> dwellers, it’s just another Tuesday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/77aa7a40fe70dff91ab9c2746c824d0d.poster.avif?t=1775540281\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/77aa7a40fe70dff91ab9c2746c824d0d.webm?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/77aa7a40fe70dff91ab9c2746c824d0d.mp4?t=1775540281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You’ll Play Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt is different. Patrol routes, bombardments, and officer searches change every run. Your only chance is to adapt. Will you risk moving or stay hidden in the dark?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Stranded in Conflict to your Steam Wishlists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/8df46a41ddf87ac1ffdb7dc142033c38.poster.avif?t=1775540281\" width=780 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/8df46a41ddf87ac1ffdb7dc142033c38.webm?t=1775540281\" ty